  "releaseNotes": "- Refactored legacy classes into partial components while preserving the existing public API and behavior.\n\t\t  - Updated MVCCore to optionally route publish info, online, session creation/logout, role catalog, and user profile operations through WAPI with operation-specific WCF fallback policies.\n\t\t  - Added feature-flagged WAPI authentication and token validation for MVC.\n\t\t  - Added WAPI endpoint, feature flag, and timeout settings to RSAppSettings.\n\t\t  - Added configurable, responsive, HTML-encoded FixErrors email reports with separate info/error palettes, optional company tags, and email throttle control.\n\t\t  - Improved DataContract and AuthWCF compatibility boundaries.\n\t\t  - Added .NET Framework 4.8 characterization tests and migration validation documentation.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
  "title": "DVO.Core",
